{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwMx9ALD2jsBU7JUkWku","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I built the dashboard and created the alert rule, and the rule is enabled. Its first run finished with status `ok`, so the query runs without errors. I haven't seen it fire or opened the dashboard to look at the charts.\n\n**1. What the data holds:** each document in `kibana_sample_data_logs` is one web request. The fields include:\n- **Time:** `timestamp`, which the data view uses as its time field.\n- **Visitor:** `clientip`, `agent`, `machine.os` and location fields (`geo.src`, `geo.dest`, `geo.coordinates`).\n- **Request:** `request`, `url`, `extension`, `referer`, `host`.\n- **Result:** `response` (the HTTP status code, stored as text) and `bytes`.\n\n**2. Dashboard \"EFF-eeb164b7 Web logs overview\"** (http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-eeb164b7-web-logs-overview-39e8ed1447b3) has 7 panels:\n- Total requests\n- Unique visitors (distinct client IPs)\n- Total bytes served\n- Requests over time (line chart)\n- Breakdown of response codes (pie chart)\n- Top 10 requested URLs, with request count and bytes (table)\n- Top 10 source countries (bar chart)\n\n**3. Alert rule \"EFF-eeb164b7 5xx spike\"** (id `db92a867-89af-42cd-ae5c-843e1413d98a`):\n- It checks `kibana_sample_data_logs` every minute.\n- It fires when more than 10 requests with a response code from 500 to 599 arrive within the last 5 minutes, measured on `timestamp`.\n- Because the response code is stored as text, the rule matches it as a text range from \"500\" up to \"600\", which picks out exactly the 5xx codes.\n- No notification action is attached, so when it fires the alert only appears in Kibana and nobody is notified. If you want a Slack, email or other notification, tell me which and I'll add it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":224,"cache_read_input_tokens":20415,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":224},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4eb1cb7-866c-5bbf-8d81-a8d5acd83be3","uuid":"53a7e5c9-0e49-4723-9df8-50a6ecbe327d","timestamp":"2026-10-12T00:02:21.377Z","request_id":"req_011CfwMx8xRmYUbPkDxoNmcC"}
